== Gemini's point on #694
TestKVPages_prefillKernelsReadTheTable now perturbs the value row at each checked position as well as the key row, so an offset inside a block on the V side cannot be shared by both arms. Green on all 8 kernels.

== Open, not KV5-4's: the recurrent step against decode
On the six recurrent hybrids (nemotron-tiny, qwen35-tiny, qwen35vl-tiny, qwen3next-tiny, qwen3_5-tiny, qwen3_5_moe-tiny), a batched step row differs from decoding the same token on its own slot, on every logit, when the slot's history was built by single-token decodes or PrefillLast. The same on main at 89bd22e8 with this slice's code put back, at 20-token prompts, with prefill and verify replaced by decodes, and with ForwardEmb or metalResident.Forward as the reference. TestMC3Step_recurrentBitIdentical passes; it builds its histories with ForwardBatch on mirror slots. Not chased here: G1a's decode reference skips recurrent fixtures and says why, and their scrambled-against-in-order comparison still runs. Raised with the coordinator.

